WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Check the report and dates
Choose a prepared reporting period for this store. The dates must match
the available generated result; another store is outside this account’s
report scope.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Download the private result
When ready, choose Download. The JSON file belongs to the requesting
account and is available for 24 hours from the request, while export
access remains valid.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
New filters need a new export
Changing the period clears the old download from this screen. Choose an
available result before requesting another export. Vendor workspace
changes also clear old results.
